  "management_type_reason": "RHS・MBG・Walters・stauden.de（品種）: こぼれ種を防ぎ花を増やすため花がらを摘む、咲き終わった茎を株元の葉まで切る。non-invasive と明記で E ではない",
  "management_type_quote": "Remove faded flowers to encourage more buds, also to prevent plants from self seeding all over.",
  "management_type_by_matching": "B 花後刈込型",
